        "The check was rejected, no attempts remain in this phase, and rounds remain": {
          "does": "The round number goes up by one and the attempt number goes back to 1. The code is discarded if it was being written from nothing. Then a design session is started in the new round.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "name": "DiscardCode",
              "payload": {},
              "when": "The code is being written from nothing"
            },
            {
              "name": "StartSession",
              "payload": {
                "attempt": 1,
                "phase": "design",
                "round": {
                  "$ref": "calculation:nextRound"
